lds that are not explicitly set in the struct being saved.\n\n- Replaced `Save()` with `Updates()` in multiple database persistence operations to prevent overwriting NULL database values with zero values from nil pointer fields\n- Added a specialized update pattern in `BackfillNodeIPs` using `Updates()` with `Select()` to explicitly control which fields are updated\n- Added comprehensive regression tests to validate expiry preservation and user field preservation\n\n### Reviewed Changes\n\nCopilot reviewed 7 out of 7 changed files in this pull request and generated 1 comment.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Show a summary per file</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| hscontrol/state/state.go | Changed `Save()` to `Updates()` in `UpdateUser`, `persistNodeToDB`, `HandleNodeFromAuthPath`, and `HandleNodeFromPreAuthKey` to preserve unchanged database fields |\r\n| hscontrol/state/expiry_test.go | Added regression test reproducing the expiry reset bug when MapRequest updates a node |\r\n| hscontrol/db/users.go | Changed `RenameUser` to use `Updates()` instead of `Save()` |\r\n| hscontrol/db/user_update_test.go | Added tests validating that `Updates()` preserves unchanged user fields |\r\n| hscontrol/db/preauth_keys.go | Changed `UsePreAuthKey` to use `Model().Update()` for single field updates |\r\n| hscontrol/db/node.go | Removed deprecated `NodeSave()` function |\r\n| hscontrol/db/ip.go | Changed `BackfillNodeIPs` to use `Updates()` with `Select()` for targeted IP field updates |\n</details>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/juanfont/headscale/new/main/.github/instructions?filename=*.instructions.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add Copilot custom instructions</a> for smarter, more guided reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/customizing-copilot/adding-repository-custom-instructions-for-github-copilot\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn how to get started</a>.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2875#pullrequestreview-3447542262","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/2875","author_association":"NONE","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2875#pullrequestreview-3447542262"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/2875"}},"submitted_at":"2025-11-11T11:15:53Z","commit_id":"d88c39cc00266b01c5e4b7c9aa5d6df3cdbd5727"},{"id":3448455242,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOEFLz887Ni0BK","user":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2875#pullrequestreview-3448455242","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/2875","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2875#pullrequestreview-3448455242"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/2875"}},"submitted_at":"2025-11-11T14:52:27Z","commit_id":"d88c39cc00266b01c5e